    can only use this effect of "Weaver of Fairy Tails" once per turn. If you Normal
    or Special Summon a non-EARTH "Fairy Tail" monster, while this card is in your
    Monster Zone (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 Effect Monster
    your opponent controls; negate its effects, also its name becomes "Prince of
    Fairies".'
